pple/annual-2024.txt:3077:          Each of the Notes were issued under the applicable Indenture, which provides that debt securities may be issued under such Indenture from time to\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3078:time in one or more series. The Indentures and the Notes are governed by, and construed in accordance with, the laws of the State of New York. The Indentures\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3134:Accordingly, the Notes are effectively subordinated to creditors, including trade creditors and preferred stockholders, if any, of our subsidiaries. The Indentures\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3148:dollars will not constitute an event of default under such Notes or the applicable Indenture.\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3170:2042 Notes so made in U.S. dollars will not constitute an event of default under such Notes or the 2013 Indenture.\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3307:Indenture.\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3339:         The Indentures set forth limited covenants that apply to the Notes. However, these covenants do not, among other things:\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3348:         The Indentures provide that we may consolidate with or merge with or into any other person, and may sell, transfer, or lease or convey all or\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3354:             the debt securities and the applicable Indenture and, for each security that by its terms provides for conversion, provide for the right to convert such\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3357:         •   immediately after giving effect to such transaction, no default or event of default under the applicable Indenture has occurred and is continuing; and\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3359:         •   in the case of the 2013 Indenture, the trustee receives from us an officers’ certificate and an opinion of counsel that the transaction and such\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3360: 