ave offered to the trustee security or indemnity\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3480:          Modification and amendments of the Indentures and the Notes may be made by us and the trustee with the consent of the holders of not less than a\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3490:             2018 Indenture, it being understood that a change to any notice requirement with respect to such date shall not be deemed to be a change of such\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3500:         •   reduce the requirements for quorum or voting by holders of Notes in the applicable Indenture or the Note;\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3502:         •   modify any of the provisions in the applicable Indenture regarding the waiver of past defaults and the waiver of certain covenants by the holders of\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3503:             Notes except to increase any percentage vote required or to provide that certain other provisions of the applicable Indenture cannot be modified or\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3512:         We and the trustee may, without the consent of any holders, modify or amend the terms of the Indentures and any series of Notes with respect to the\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3518:             applicable Indenture pursuant to the covenant described above under the caption “Covenants—Consolidation, Merger and Sale of Assets”;\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3525:\f         •    to add one or more guarantees, and in the case of the 2018 Indenture, co-obligors, for the benefit of holders of the Notes;\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3527:         •    to secure the Notes pursuant to the covenants of the Indenture;\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3533:         •    to establish the form or terms of the debt securities of any series as permitted by the Indenture;\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3539:         •    in the case of the 2013 Indenture, to add to, change or eliminate any of the provisions of the 2013 Indenture in respect of one or more series of\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3544:         •    in the case of the 2018 Indenture, to add to, change or eliminate any of the provisions of the 2018 Indenture in respect of one or more series of\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3552:              the 2013 Indenture any series, and in the case of the 2018 Indenture, any outstanding series, in any material respect;\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3554:         •    to supplement any of the provisions of the applicable Indenture to such extent as shall be necessary to permit or facilitate the defeasance and\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3555:              discharge of any series of Notes pursuant to the Indenture; provided that any such action shall not adversely affect the interests of the holders of\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3561:         •    to add to, change or eliminate any of the provisions of the applicable Indenture as shall be necessary or desirable in accordance with any\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3562:              amendments to the Trust Indenture Act of 1939, as amended, and in the case of the 2013 Indenture, provided that such action does not adversely\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3566:series, waive compliance by us with certain restrictive provisions of the Indentures. The holders of not less than a majority in aggregate principal amount of the\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3568:Indenture with respect to the Notes of that series, except a default (1) in the payment of principal or premium, if any, or interest on Notes of that series or (2) in\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3569:respect of a covenant or provision of the applicable Indenture that cannot be modified or amended without the consent of the holder of each Note of that series.\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3571:Indenture; however, no such waiver will extend to any subsequent or other default or event of default or impair any rights consequent thereon.\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3585:          The Indentures provide that we may elect either (1) to defease and be discharged from any and all obligations with respect to the Notes of a series\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3588:to comply with the restrictive covenants under the applicable Indenture, and any omission to comply with such obligations will not constitute a default or an event\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3636:              the applicable Indenture and we do not appoint a successor depository within 90 days;\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3647:          The Bank of New York Mellon Trust Company, N.A. is the trustee under the Indentures. We have commercial deposits and custodial arrangements with\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3655:\f                                                                                                                                    Exhibit 10.19\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3925:\fnot materially and adversely affect the interests of the Participant hereunder, but no such waiver shall operate as or be construed to be a\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3960:\f                                                                                                                                   Exhibit 10.20\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:3993:Employee Stock Plan and the Terms and Conditions of Restricted Stock Unit Award - Performance Award (including Exhibit A thereto), which are\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:4014:Terms (including Exhibit A hereto, incorporated herein by this reference) are collectively referred to as the “Award Agreement” applicable to the\ndocs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.txt:4023:Exhibit A hereto. (The vesting date set forth in the Grant Notice is referred to herein as a “Vesting Date”).\ndocs/